show hostname
show interfaces nope
show ip interface brief | include Interface
show interfaces status | include Port
show version | include Hostname
show version | include Architecture | count
show ip
show ip route | include Codes
show ipv6 route | include Codes
show arp | include Address
show processes | include PID | count
show ip route nonsense
show ip route 999.1.1.1
show ipv6 route 1.2.3.4
quit
